### Interview API examples

POST http://localhost:5080/api/interview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicationId": 1,
  "date": "2026-04-01",
  "time": "09:00:00",
  "round": 1,
  "type": "Phone",
  "platform": "Zoom",
  "link": "https://zoom.us/..",
  "building": "HQ",
  "room": "101",
  "status": "SCHEDULED",
  "interviewerName": "John Doe"
}

GET http://localhost:5080/api/interview

GET http://localhost:5080/api/interview/1

PUT http://localhost:5080/api/interview/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicationId": 1,
  "date": "2026-04-02",
  "time": "10:00:00",
  "round": 1,
